  "date": "2026-11-28T17:06:44Z",
  "subject": "feat(okd): manage the metal1 image mirror sets with ArgoCD",
  "body": "The ImageDigestMirrorSet and the new ImageTagMirrorSet were applied by hand, so\nArgoCD did not show them. Add them as app okd-image-mirrors-metal1 (picked up by\nthe okd-operators ApplicationSet). Content is identical to what is live: each of\nquay.io, docker.io, ghcr.io, mirror.gcr.io and registry.access.redhat.com maps to\nits own Nexus host. Adopting them does not change the cluster, so no MachineConfig\nrollout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n"
}
